    "Compatible native hosts render the interactive MCP App inline. Other Codex and Claude surfaces keep exact JSON and receive a PNG metric-chart fallback. Fresh acquisition and export mutations require approval.": {
      "comment": "macOS production UI",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Compatible native hosts render the interactive MCP App inline. Other Codex and Claude surfaces keep exact JSON and receive a PNG metric-chart fallback. Fresh acquisition and export mutations require approval."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Kompatible native Hosts rendern die interaktive MCP-App inline. Andere Codex- und Claude-Oberflächen behalten den exakten JSON bei und erhalten ein PNG-Metrikdiagramm-Fallback. Neue Erwerbs- und Exportmutationen bedürfen einer Genehmigung."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Los hosts nativos compatibles procesan la aplicación interactiva MCP en línea. Otras superficies Codex y Claude mantienen el JSON exacto y reciben un gráfico alternativo de métricas PNG. Las mutaciones de nuevas adquisiciones y exportaciones requieren aprobación."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Les hôtes natifs compatibles rendent l'application interactive MCP en ligne. Les autres surfaces Codex et Claude conservent exactement JSON et reçoivent un diagramme métrique PNG de secours. Les nouvelles mutations d’acquisition et d’exportation nécessitent une approbation."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Gli host nativi compatibili rendono l'app MCP interattiva in linea. Altre superfici Codex e Claude mantengono l'esatto JSON e ricevono un fallback del grafico metrico PNG. Le nuove acquisizioni e le mutazioni di esportazione richiedono l'approvazione."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "互換性のあるネイティブ ホストは、インタラクティブな MCP アプリをインラインでレンダリングします。他の Codex および Claude サーフェスは、正確な JSON を維持し、PNG メトリック チャートのフォールバックを受け取ります。新たな取得および輸出の突然変異には承認が必要です。"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "호환되는 네이티브 호스트는 대화형 MCP 앱을 인라인으로 렌더링합니다. 다른 Codex 및 Claude 환경에서는 정확한 JSON을 유지하고 PNG 지표 차트를 대체 자료로 받습니다. 새 데이터 수집 및 내보내기 변경에는 승인이 필요합니다."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Compatibele native hosts maken de interactieve MCP-app inline. Andere Codex- en Claude-oppervlakken behouden de exacte JSON en ontvangen een fallback voor metrische PNG-diagrammen. Nieuwe acquisitie- en exportmutaties vereisen goedkeuring."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Hosts nativos compatíveis renderizam o aplicativo MCP interativo inline. Outras superfícies Codex e Claude mantêm JSON exato e recebem um substituto de gráfico métrico PNG. Novas mutações de aquisição e exportação requerem aprovação."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "兼容的原生主机可内嵌呈现交互式 MCP App。其他 Codex 和 Claude 界面会保留完整 JSON，并接收 PNG 指标图表作为后备。获取新数据和修改导出内容需要批准。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
