    "Each run exports the past %lld days ending with yesterday.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Bei jedem Durchlauf werden die letzten %lld Tage bis einschließlich gestern exportiert."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cada ejecución exporta los últimos %lld días hasta ayer inclusive."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Chaque exécution exporte les %lld derniers jours jusqu’à hier inclus."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ogni esecuzione esporta gli ultimi %lld giorni fino a ieri incluso."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "実行のたびに、昨日までの過去%lld日分を書き出します。"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "실행할 때마다 어제까지의 지난 %lld일 데이터를 내보냅니다."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Elke uitvoering exporteert de afgelopen %lld dagen tot en met gisteren."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cada execução exporta os últimos %lld dias até ontem, inclusive."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "每次运行都会导出截至昨天的过去 %lld 天数据。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Each run exports the past 1 day ending with yesterday.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Bei jedem Durchlauf wird der letzte Tag bis einschließlich gestern exportiert."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cada ejecución exporta el último día hasta ayer inclusive."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Chaque exécution exporte le dernier jour jusqu’à hier inclus."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ogni esecuzione esporta l’ultimo giorno fino a ieri incluso."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "実行のたびに、昨日までの過去1日分を書き出します。"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "실행할 때마다 어제까지의 지난 1일 데이터를 내보냅니다."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Elke uitvoering exporteert de afgelopen dag tot en met gisteren."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cada execução exporta o último dia até ontem, inclusive."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "每次运行都会导出截至昨天的过去 1 天数据。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Edit `SKILLS_DIR` to match the folder your agent reads. The app installer replaces the Health.md skill folder; the shell command overwrites only `SKILL.md`.": {
      "comment": "macOS production UI",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Edit `SKILLS_DIR` to match the folder your agent reads. The app installer replaces the Health.md skill folder; the shell command overwrites only `SKILL.md`."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Bearbeiten Sie `SKILLS_DIR` so, dass es mit dem Ordner übereinstimmt, den Ihr Agent liest. Das App-Installationsprogramm ersetzt den Skill-Ordner Health.md; Der Shell-Befehl überschreibt nur `SKILL.md`."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Edite `SKILLS_DIR` para que coincida con la carpeta que lee su agente. El instalador de la aplicación reemplaza la carpeta de habilidades Health.md; el comando de shell solo sobrescribe `SKILL.md`."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Modifiez `SKILLS_DIR` pour qu'il corresponde au dossier lu par votre agent. Le programme d'installation de l'application remplace le dossier de compétences Health.md ; la commande shell écrase uniquement `SKILL.md`."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Modifica `SKILLS_DIR` in modo che corrisponda alla cartella letta dall'agente. Il programma di installazione dell'app sostituisce la cartella delle competenze Health.md; il comando shell sovrascrive solo `SKILL.md`."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "エージェントが読み取るフォルダーと一致するように `SKILLS_DIR` を編集します。アプリ インストーラーは、Health.md スキル フォルダーを置き換えます。シェル コマンドは `SKILL.md` のみを上書きします。"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "에이전트가 읽는 폴더와 일치하도록 `SKILLS_DIR`를 편집하세요. 앱 설치 프로그램은 Health.md 스킬 폴더를 대체합니다. 쉘 명령은 `SKILL.md`만 덮어씁니다."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Bewerk `SKILLS_DIR` zodat deze overeenkomt met de map die uw agent leest. Het app-installatieprogramma vervangt de vaardighedenmap Health.md; de shell-opdracht overschrijft alleen `SKILL.md`."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Edite `SKILLS_DIR` para corresponder à pasta que seu agente lê. O instalador do aplicativo substitui a pasta de habilidades Health.md; o comando shell substitui apenas `SKILL.md`."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "编辑 `SKILLS_DIR` 以匹配您的代理读取的文件夹。应用程序安装程序替换Health.md技能文件夹； shell 命令仅覆盖 `SKILL.md`。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
