          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Lossless Health Records is enabled. An export this large with lossless records can run for hours and may run out of memory before it finishes. Turn off Lossless Health Records first for a faster summary-only export.": {
      "comment": "Stronger warning shown in the large export confirmation alert when Lossless Health Records is enabled",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Lossless Health Records is enabled. An export this large with lossless records can run for hours and may run out of memory before it finishes. Turn off Lossless Health Records first for a faster summary-only export."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Lossless Health Records retains every selected HealthKit source record alongside daily summaries, including source UUIDs, exact timestamps, provenance, metadata, and detailed series. Files may be much larger. Turn it off on iPhone for summary-only exports.": {
      "comment": "macOS production UI",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Lossless Health Records retains every selected HealthKit source record alongside daily summaries, including source UUIDs, exact timestamps, provenance, metadata, and detailed series. Files may be much larger. Turn it off on iPhone for summary-only exports."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Lossless Health Records speichert jeden ausgewählten HealthKit-Quelldatensatz zusammen mit täglichen Zusammenfassungen, einschließlich Quell-UUIDs, genauen Zeitstempeln, Herkunft, Metadaten und detaillierten Serien. Dateien können viel größer sein. Deaktivieren Sie es auf iPhone für reine Zusammenfassungsexporte."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Los registros de salud sin pérdida conservan cada registro de origen de HealthKit seleccionado junto con los resúmenes diarios, incluidos los UUID de origen, las marcas de tiempo exactas, la procedencia, los metadatos y las series detalladas. Los archivos pueden ser mucho más grandes. Desactívelos en el iPhone para exportar solo resúmenes."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Lossless Health Records conserve chaque enregistrement source HealthKit sélectionné ainsi que des résumés quotidiens, y compris la source UUIDs, les horodatages exacts, la provenance, les métadonnées et les séries détaillées. Les fichiers peuvent être beaucoup plus volumineux. Désactivez-le sur iPhone pour les exportations de résumé uniquement."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Lossless Health Records conserva ogni record di origine HealthKit selezionato insieme a riepiloghi giornalieri, inclusa la fonte UUIDs, timestamp esatti, provenienza, metadati e serie dettagliate. I file potrebbero essere molto più grandi. Disattivalo su iPhone per le esportazioni di solo riepilogo."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Lossless Health Records は、選択されたすべての HealthKit ソース レコードを、ソース UUIDs、正確なタイムスタンプ、来歴、メタデータ、詳細なシリーズなどの毎日の概要とともに保持します。ファイルはさらに大きくなる可能性があります。概要のみのエクスポートの場合は、iPhone でオフにします。"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "무손실 건강 기록은 소스 UUIDs, 정확한 타임스탬프, 출처, 메타데이터 및 세부 시리즈를 포함하여 일일 요약과 함께 선택된 모든 HealthKit 소스 기록을 유지합니다. 파일 크기가 훨씬 커질 수 있습니다. 요약 전용 내보내기의 경우 iPhone에서 이 기능을 끄십시오."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Lossless Health Records bewaart elk geselecteerd HealthKit-bronrecord naast dagelijkse samenvattingen, inclusief bron UUIDs, exacte tijdstempels, herkomst, metagegevens en gedetailleerde reeksen. Bestanden kunnen veel groter zijn. Schakel dit uit op iPhone voor exports met alleen samenvattingen."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Lossless Health Records retém todos os registros de origem HealthKit selecionados junto com resumos diários, incluindo origem UUIDs, carimbos de data/hora exatos, procedência, metadados e séries detalhadas. Os arquivos podem ser muito maiores. Desative-o em iPhone para exportações apenas de resumo."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "无损健康记录保留每条选定的 HealthKit 源记录以及每日摘要，包括源 UUIDs、确切的时间戳、出处、元数据和详细系列。文件可能会大得多。在 iPhone 上将其关闭以进行仅摘要导出。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
