    "Open Health.md on your iPhone, go to Mac Destination, and enable the Mac destination toggle. Then choose a destination folder on this Mac and select Connected Mac from the iPhone Export tab.": {
      "comment": "macOS production UI",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Open Health.md on your iPhone, go to Mac Destination, and enable the Mac destination toggle. Then choose a destination folder on this Mac and select Connected Mac from the iPhone Export tab."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Öffnen Sie Health.md auf Ihrem iPhone, gehen Sie zu Mac-Ziel und aktivieren Sie den Mac-Zielumschalter. Wählen Sie dann einen Zielordner auf diesem Mac und wählen Sie „Verbundenes Mac“ auf der Registerkarte „Exportieren“ von iPhone aus."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Abra Health.md en su iPhone, vaya a Destino Mac y habilite la opción de alternar destino Mac. Luego elija una carpeta de destino en este Mac y seleccione Mac conectado en la pestaña Exportar iPhone."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ouvrez Health.md sur votre iPhone, accédez à Destination Mac et activez la bascule de destination Mac. Choisissez ensuite un dossier de destination sur ce Mac et sélectionnez Mac connecté dans l'onglet Exportation iPhone."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Apri Health.md sul tuo iPhone, vai alla destinazione Mac e abilita l'interruttore della destinazione Mac. Quindi scegli una cartella di destinazione su questo Mac e seleziona Connesso Mac dalla scheda Esporta iPhone."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "iPhone で Health.md を開き、Mac 宛先に移動し、Mac 宛先切り替えを有効にします。次に、この Mac 上の宛先フォルダーを選択し、iPhone エクスポート タブから接続済み Mac を選択します。"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "iPhone에서 Health.md를 열고 Mac 대상으로 이동한 다음 Mac 대상 토글을 활성화합니다. 그런 다음 이 Mac에서 대상 폴더를 선택하고 iPhone 내보내기 탭에서 연결된 Mac를 선택합니다."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Open Health.md op uw iPhone, ga naar Mac-bestemming en schakel de bestemmingsschakelaar Mac in. Kies vervolgens een doelmap op deze Mac en selecteer Verbonden Mac op het tabblad iPhone Exporteren."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Abra Health.md em seu iPhone, vá para Destino Mac e ative a alternância de destino Mac. Em seguida, escolha uma pasta de destino neste Mac e selecione Mac conectado na guia Exportar iPhone."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在 iPhone 上打开 Health.md，转至 Mac 目标位置，然后启用 Mac 目标位置切换。然后选择此 Mac 上的目标文件夹，并从 iPhone 导出选项卡中选择已连接的 Mac。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
