    "Use this Mac app as a local destination for exports started from Health.md on iPhone. The Mac app does not sell or gate access.": {
      "comment": "macOS production UI",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Use this Mac app as a local destination for exports started from Health.md on iPhone. The Mac app does not sell or gate access."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Verwenden Sie diese Mac-App als lokales Ziel für Exporte, die von Health.md auf iPhone gestartet wurden. Die Mac-App verkauft oder verschafft keinen Zugriff."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Utilice esta aplicación Mac como destino local para las exportaciones iniciadas desde Health.md en iPhone. La aplicación Mac no vende ni bloquea el acceso."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Utilisez cette app Mac comme destination locale pour les exportations lancées depuis Health.md sur iPhone. L’app Mac ne vend pas l’accès et ne le restreint pas."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Utilizza questa app Mac come destinazione locale per le esportazioni avviate da Health.md su iPhone. L'app Mac non vende né vieta l'accesso."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "この Mac アプリを、iPhone 上の Health.md から開始したエクスポートのローカル保存先として使用します。Mac アプリでアクセス権の販売や制限は行いません。"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "이 Mac 앱을 iPhone의 Health.md에서 시작된 내보내기의 로컬 대상으로 사용하세요. Mac 앱은 액세스 권한을 판매하거나 게이트하지 않습니다."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Gebruik deze Mac-app als lokale bestemming voor exporten gestart vanuit Health.md op iPhone. De Mac-app verkoopt of geeft geen toegang."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Use este aplicativo Mac como destino local para exportações iniciadas de Health.md em iPhone. O aplicativo Mac não vende nem bloqueia acesso."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "使用此 Mac 应用程序作为从 iPhone 上的 Health.md 开始的导出的本地目的地。 Mac 应用程序不出售或控制访问权限。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Use this for Tailscale or networks where automatic discovery cannot find your Mac.": {
      "localizations": {
